import LOEIS.A360.A360285.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A360285

Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of subsets of {1,...,n} of cardinality k in which no two elements are coprime; n >= 0, 0 <= k <= floor(n/2) + [n=1].

The 82 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

